      "comment" : "Prayers tab, home's hour row: one short line saying what an order of prayer of the day is, under its name"
    },
    "A short reading on the mystery" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding, What You'll Hear slide: the first of a decade's four parts, the meditation"
    },
    "A short reflection on the mystery, often with a prayer at the end. The words come from preachers and the Church's great teachers. Read it once, then keep it in mind through the ten Hail Marys.\n\nSt. Alphonsus Liguori · Venerable Fulton J. Sheen · St. John Henry Newman · St. Thomas Aquinas" : {
      "comment" : "Kinds of Meditation sheet, the Reflections card: what this kind of meditation is, then after a blank line some authors who wrote it (keep the names; the blank line stays)"
