    "One question to sit with, and a journal to answer it in." : {
      "comment" : "Consecration introduction, page 3: what the day's third step, Reflect, holds"
    },
    "One short note, when you finish a Rosary prayed with meditations: which meditations they were, and whether you listened to the Whole Rosary. Our server keeps it with the time and an approximate city, region and country, looked up through ipapi.co from the address your phone connects from, and keeps that address only in a shortened form. No name, account or device identifier goes with it, so two Rosaries prayed on one phone look like two prayed by strangers. We use these notes only to learn which meditations are prayed, and roughly where. The Scriptural Rosary, the Audio Rosary and the guided Rosary send nothing, and nothing else reaches us unless you write to us." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy Policy: a section's text; keep it as plain and exact as the English"
    },
